WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.003
The ogre stood in the doorway.

2
00:00:09.004 --> 00:00:12.932
Puss was trapped!

3
00:00:12.933 --> 00:00:17.188
The ogre smiled, showing rotten teeth.

4
00:00:17.189 --> 00:00:20.624
"You must stay," he said.

5
00:00:20.625 --> 00:00:24.590
"I rarely have visitors."

6
00:00:24.591 --> 00:00:27.390
Puss sat down.

7
00:00:27.391 --> 00:00:32.760
"I'll escape when I get a chance," he thought.

8
00:00:32.761 --> 00:00:36.312
The ogre took a board from a shelf.

9
00:00:36.313 --> 00:00:43.845
He sat down.

10
00:00:43.846 --> 00:00:48.362
"Let's play checkers," the ogre said.

11
00:00:48.363 --> 00:00:54.031
"If you win, I'll let you leave."

12
00:00:54.032 --> 00:00:59.129
"It's a deal," Puss said.

13
00:00:59.130 --> 00:01:03.556
Puss and the ogre played checkers.

14
00:01:03.557 --> 00:01:08.325
"When did you buy this castle?" Puss asked.

15
00:01:08.326 --> 00:01:14.705
"I didn't buy it." The ogre chuckled.

16
00:01:14.706 --> 00:01:19.380
"I ate the last owner!"

17
00:01:19.381 --> 00:01:23.483
Puss gulped.

18
00:01:23.484 --> 00:01:28.327
The ogre was soon winning the game.

19
00:01:28.328 --> 00:01:33.224
"I took a lot of his checkers," Puss thought.

20
00:01:33.225 --> 00:01:36.733
"How does he still have so many?"

21
00:01:36.734 --> 00:01:40.463
Puss watched the ogre closely.

22
00:01:40.464 --> 00:01:44.642
He saw something hidden in the ogre's hand.

23
00:01:44.643 --> 00:01:48.674
"More checkers!" Puss thought.

24
00:01:48.675 --> 00:01:54.092
He stood up and pointed at the ogre. "Cheater!"

25
00:01:54.093 --> 00:01:58.314
The ogre laughed.

26
00:01:58.315 --> 00:02:01.391
"Our deal is off," Puss said.

27
00:02:01.392 --> 00:02:03.757
"I'm leaving now."

28
00:02:03.758 --> 00:02:05.754
The ogre stood up.

29
00:02:05.755 --> 00:02:07.998
"You're not leaving.

30
00:02:07.999 --> 00:02:13.765
It's almost time for lunch!"

31
00:02:13.766 --> 00:02:17.981
"I'm not staying for lunch," Puss said.

32
00:02:17.982 --> 00:02:23.729
"Yes, you are, Cat!" The ogre growled.

33
00:02:23.730 --> 00:02:29.565
"Because you are lunch!"

34
00:02:29.566 --> 00:02:38.959
The ogre grabbed Puss and threw him into a cage.

